@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Melihat Riwayat Presensi
autonumber

actor "Siswa / Wali Siswa" as User
boundary "UI_RiwayatPresensi" as UI
control "Control_Presensi" as Control
entity "T_Presensi" as E_Presensi

== Skenario: Menampilkan Riwayat Presensi ==

User -> UI : 1. Mengakses Menu "Riwayat Presensi"
activate UI
UI -> Control : 2. RequestDataRiwayat(ID_Siswa, Page=1)
activate Control

Control -> E_Presensi : 3. AmbilDataPresensi(ID_Siswa, Order=Desc, Limit=20)
activate E_Presensi
E_Presensi --> Control : 4. DataDitemukan(Data)
deactivate E_Presensi

Control -> Control : 5. Kalkulasi Rekapitulasi per Bulan (Hadir, Sakit, Izin, Alpha)

Control --> UI : 6. TampilkanHalamanRiwayat(Data, Rekapitulasi)
deactivate Control
UI --> User : 7. Tabel Harian & Ringkasan Bulanan Terbuka
deactivate UI

== Skenario: Menggunakan Navigasi Paginasi ==

User -> UI : 8. Klik Navigasi Paginasi (Misal: Halaman 2)
activate UI
UI -> Control : 9. RequestDataRiwayat(ID_Siswa, Page=2)
activate Control

Control -> E_Presensi : 10. AmbilDataPresensi(ID_Siswa, Order=Desc, Limit=20, Offset=20)
activate E_Presensi
E_Presensi --> Control : 11. DataDitemukan(Data)
deactivate E_Presensi

Control --> UI : 12. UpdateTabelRiwayat(Data)
deactivate Control
UI --> User : 13. Tampilan Tabel Diperbarui (Memuat Blok Data Selanjutnya)
deactivate UI

@enduml
